    "body": "This PR updates the libsecp256k1 subtree to https://github.com/bitcoin-core/secp256k1/commit/a0e2e23a71bf2aaae910f81cb2bd8aa0ae49d544, which includes the following changes:\n\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1893\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1935\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1918\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1840\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1934\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1942\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1947\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1948\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1949\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1933\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1946\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1950\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1953\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1963\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1866\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1929\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1943\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1952\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1965\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1975\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1961\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1978\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1937\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1983\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1974\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1986\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1992\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1972\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1995\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1999\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1898\n- bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1998\n\nThe update is prompted by new warnings introduced in Clang 24. bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1998 fixed them in the secp256k1 subtree. A fix for Bitcoin Core is here: https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36869.",
