78: ci: Run ctime_tests in the arm64 Debian job\n95798f5f92 Merge bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1961: ci: run exhaustive_tests for group orders 7 and 199\n307035b302 Merge bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1975: ci: Run ctime_tests under Valgrind on arm64\n1c1d849491 ci: Run ctime_tests in the arm64 Debian job\n26299c7672 ci: Run ctime_tests under Valgrind on arm64\n70f321c334 tests: silentpayments: deduplicate prevouts summary setup\n67916d9bbc tests: silentpayments: deduplicate label cache setup\n9c6ece8bdd tests: silentpayments: deduplicate output tweak\na3fcbeafe3 ci: run exhaustive_tests for group orders 7 and 199\n32099110d6 tests: don't define the ellswift exhaustive test for even-order curves\ne74a0187aa Merge bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1965: remove unused SECP256K1_GE_CONST_INFINITY\nd2cbca372a Merge bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1952: util: make STATIC_ASSERT usable at file scope\n60804dc2ec Merge bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1943: tests: silentpayments: cover labeled output beyond the first label batch\n7b59e1fc42 remove unused SECP256K1_GE_CONST_INFINITY\n04b91ce295 Merge bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1929: silentpayments: perform tweak addition with actual scalars\n0283a11d50 Merge bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1866: musig: Add hash context tests\n31716e4bb6 Merge bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1963: doc: say the sha256 compression callback processes secrets\n494d3053c0 doc: say the sha256 compression callback processes secrets\n0c3c70d5f7 tests: silentpayments: cover labeled output beyond the first label batch\n22245aedf4 Merge bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1953: ci: bump macOS ARM64 runner to macos-15\n146def9812 ci: bump macOS ARM64 runner to macos-15\n186eec1c1b Merge bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1950: tests: silentpayments: check found outputs are distinct in vector tests\nd6ec1ab4da tests: silentpayments: cover rejection of invalid keypair alongside a valid one\n1c6f793084 tests: silentpayments: check found outputs are distinct in vector tests\n6f065e9ad2 Merge bitcoin-core/secp256k1#1946: doc: clean up lingering EC